"popups/SRMOrderContractRequest/ocDeleteConfirmModal.html": "<div class=\"modal-backdrop\" id=\"ocDeleteConfirmModal\" role=\"alertdialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"ocDeleteConfirmTitle\" aria-hidden=\"false\">\n    <div class=\"modal-dialog\">\n      <div class=\"modal-header\"><h2 class=\"modal-title\" id=\"ocDeleteConfirmTitle\">발주계약 요청 삭제 시 유의사항</h2><button type=\"button\" class=\"modal-close\" aria-label=\"닫기\">&times;</button></div>\n      <div class=\"modal-body\">\n        <div class=\"notice-box warning\" role=\"alert\">\n          <span class=\"notice-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 3 2.5 20h19L12 3Z\"/><path d=\"M12 10v4\"/><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"/></svg></span>\n          <div class=\"notice-body\">\n            <p class=\"notice-lead\">발주계약 요청 내역을 삭제하면, 매핑된(기 등록된) 세부정보가 모두 삭제됩니다.</p>\n            <p>반드시 최고관리자(시스템운영자)만 사용하세요. 그래도 진행하시겠습니까?</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-footer\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-delete modal-close\">삭제하기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-secondary modal-close\">취소</button></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>",
